From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tim 'mithro' Ansell <me@mith.ro>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 16:09:11 +0930
Subject: [PATCH 01/32] spiFlashSfdp: add JEDEC JESD216 SFDP parser

Parse the SFDP header, parameter headers, the Basic Flash Parameter
Table (density, address mode, DTR support, 1-1-2/1-2-2/2-2-2/1-1-4/
1-4-4/4-4-4 fast read opcodes with mode/dummy clocks, erase types,
page size, quad enable requirements) and the 4-Byte Address
Instruction Table (4-Byte and DTR read opcodes).

The parser only needs a read callback, so it is independent of the
SPI transport.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
